n begin="00:39.110" end="00:39.770">goes </span><span begin="00:39.770" end="00:41.000">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.000" end="00:46.490"><span begin="00:41.000" end="00:41.510">I </span><span begin="00:41.510" end="00:42.260">had </span><span begin="00:42.260" end="00:43.460">everything </span><span begin="00:43.460" end="00:44.360">opportunities </span><span begin="00:44.360" end="00:44.570">for </span><span begin="00:44.570" end="00:45.650">eternity </span><span begin="00:45.650" end="00:45.920">and </span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.490">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.490" end="00:50.180"><span begin="00:46.490" end="00:46.790">could </span><span begin="00:46.790" end="00:47.720">belong </span><span begin="00:47.720" end="00:48.020">to </span><span begin="00:48.020" end="00:48.170">the </span><span begin="00:48.170" end="00:50.180">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.630" end="00:58.730"><span begin="00:50.630" end="00:51.020">Your </span><span begin="00:51.020" end="00:51.800">eyes</span><span begin="00:51.800" end="00:51.800">, </span><span begin="00:51.800" end="00:52.190">your </span><span begin="00:52.190" end="00:53.300">eyes </span><span begin="00:53.300" end="00:53.900">I </span><span begin="00:53.900" end="00:54.470">can </span><span begin="00:54.470" end="00:55.190">see </span><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.460">in </span><span begin="00:55.460" end="00:55.880">your </span><span begin="00:55.880" end="00:56.780">eyes </span><span begin="00:56.780" end="00:57.170">your </span><span begin="00:57.170" end="00:58.730">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.330" end="01:01.610"><span begin="00:59.330" end="00:59.510">You </span><span begin="00:59.510" end="00:59.870">make </span><span begin="00:59.870" end="01:00.110">me </span><span begin="01:00.110" end="01:00.620">wanna </span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:01.610">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.700" end="01:04.190"><span begin="01: